# Cline / Roo Code Rules — পঞ্চগড় (Panchagarh)

Refer to master specifications before writing any code:
1. `docs/00_CUSTOM_INSTRUCTION.md`
2. `docs/01_FRONTEND_MASTER_PROMPT.md`
3. `docs/02_BACKEND_MASTER_PROMPT.md`
4. `docs/schema.md`

Non-negotiable:
- Integer Poisha money only.
- Double-entry balanced accounting.
- Append-only ledger; no UPDATE or DELETE on ledger records.
- COD + Manual bKash only (no payment gateways).
- No marketing tracking pixels.
- Zero-leak DTOs (strip cost, profit, and internal SKU from storefront).
- 4-solid color system from `src/styles/tokens.css`.
